  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened.",
    "Add the grated ginger and minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the curry powder, cumin, and cayenne pepper and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chickpeas, coconut milk, and salt, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Meanwhile, toast the double-rise-bread cubes until crispy.",
    "Serve the curry over the toasted bread.",
    "Garnish with fresh cilantro, if desired."
